# POLLY, factory: a song picks factory style 1 (Pop) on the Song patterns pages: KNOB 4 (Style) sets all six
# sections at once; a section's knob sets one (P01..P24, then the styles by name). It plays over the Pop
# template: Main A, Main B, the fill (from Main B: Fill BA, none yet: Fill AB's), Main A, the ending.
wait 300
tap ENV
tap ENV
expect page 9
spin K4 1
wait 50
expect song1_style0 24
expect song1_style1 25
expect song1_style2 26
expect song1_style3 27
expect song1_style4 28
expect song1_style5 29
expect slot1_nev >20
shot patterns.png
tap ENV
expect page 10
shot patterns2.png
# the Style knob back: the song's own patterns (P01..P06), then Pop again
spin K4 -1
wait 50
expect song1_style0 0
expect song1_style5 5
spin K4 1
expect song1_style1 25
# Main A's knob (page 1, KNOB 2): the next style (Funk's Main A); past either end it stays at the end (P01, the
# last style)
tap ENV
tap ENV
expect page 9
spin K2 1
expect song1_style1 31
spin K2 -300
expect song1_style1 0
spin K2 300
expect song1_style1 >30
spin K2 -300
spin K2 24
expect song1_style1 25
# Main A picked for a song with no chords: the style's tempo
expect tempo 105
# the Pop template, PLAY: Main A (the style has no Intro yet)
press SEL
key w0 down
key w0 up
release SEL
hitreset
wav pop.wav
peakreset
tap PLAY
wait 200
expect sect 2
wait 8940
expect sect 2
expect notes_out >20
expect track_hits1 >20
expect track_hits4 >6
expect track_hits5 >6
expect track_hits7 >2
expect peak_db_max -0.1
expect peak_db_min -24
# Main B for 4 bars, the fill (from B: Fill BA, none yet: Fill AB's), Main A, the ending
press SEL
tapkey b2
release SEL
wait 9140
expect sect 3
press SEL
tapkey b3
release SEL
wait 2300
expect sect 4
wait 2300
expect sect 2
press SEL
tapkey b4
release SEL
wait 7000
expect playing 0
wavstop
tap HOME
shot song.png
